<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<catalogue xmlns="http://www.battlescribe.net/schema/catalogueSchema" id="cust-36-0000000" name="Custodian Brothers - Completed" revision="10" battleScribeVersion="2.03" library="false" gameSystemId="b174-c09d-3660-f001" gameSystemRevision="5"><sharedRules><rule id="b174-c09d-3660-c104" name="Versatile Expert" hidden="false"><description>When this unit is activated, choose one effect until the end of that activation: models with this rule in this unit gain AP(+1) when attacking, or gain +1 to hit rolls when attacking.</description></rule><rule id="b174-c09d-3660-c116" name="Anti-Cover" hidden="false"><description>When attacking with this weapon, ignore the target's cover protection.</description></rule><rule id="oprv36-rule-25d" name="Steadfast" hidden="false"><description>If a unit where most models have this rule is Shaken at the beginning of the round, roll one die. On a 4+, it stops being Shaken.</description></rule><rule id="oprv36-rule-265" name="Regeneration Aura" hidden="false"><description>This model and its unit get Regeneration.</description></rule><rule id="rl36-6c0a30aef180" name="Stealth Aura" hidden="false">
      <description>This model and its unit get Stealth.</description>
    </rule><rule id="cust-36-0000001" name="Guardian" hidden="false"><description>When units where most models have this rule take hits, those hits count as having AP(-1), to a minimum of AP(0).</description></rule><rule id="cust-36-0000002" name="Disintegrate" hidden="false"><description>Ignores Regeneration, and when attacking units where most models have Tough(3) or higher, this weapon gets AP(+2).</description></rule><rule id="cust-36-0000003" name="Dodge" hidden="false"><description>If most models in this unit have this rule, as long as they aren't Fatigued, enemy units get -1 to hit rolls in melee against them.</description></rule><rule id="cust-36-0000004" name="Enhanced Guardian" hidden="false"><description>If most models in this unit have Guardian, hits they take count as having AP(-2) from Guardian (instead of only AP(-1)).</description></rule><rule id="cust-36-0000005" name="Enhanced Fortified" hidden="false"><description>If most models in this unit have Fortified, hits they take count as having AP(-2) from Fortified.</description></rule><rule id="cust-36-0000006" name="Fortified" hidden="false"><description>When units where most models have this rule take hits, those hits count as having AP(-1), to a minimum of AP(0).</description></rule><rule id="cust-36-0000007" name="Hit &amp; Run" hidden="false"><description>Once per round, this model may move by up to 3 inches after shooting or being in melee.</description></rule><rule id="cust-36-0000008" name="Hit &amp; Run Shooter" hidden="false"><description>Once per round, this model may move by up to 3 inches after shooting.</description></rule><rule id="cust-36-0000009" name="Ranged Shrouding" hidden="false"><description>When a unit where most models have this rule is targeted for shooting, enemy unit gets -4 inches range, minimum 6 inches.</description></rule><rule id="cust-36-0000010" name="Shred Mark" hidden="false"><description>Once per activation, before attacking, pick one enemy unit within 18 inches in line of sight; friendly units get Shred against it once.</description></rule><rule id="cust-36-0000011" name="Unpredictable Fighter" hidden="false"><description>When in melee, roll a die: on 1-3 this model gets AP(+1), on 4-6 gets +1 to hit rolls.</description></rule><rule id="cust-36-0000012" name="Dash" hidden="false"><description>Once per round, at the end of this unit's activation, move models with this rule up to D3+1 inches.</description></rule><rule id="cust-36-0000013" name="Piercing Target(X)" hidden="false"><description>Once per game, mark X enemy units within 18 inches and line of sight; friendly units get AP(+1) when attacking them.</description></rule><rule id="cust-36-0000014" name="Enhanced Guardian Aura" hidden="false"><description>This model and its unit get Enhanced Guardian.</description></rule><rule id="cust-36-0000015" name="Hit &amp; Run Shooter Aura" hidden="false"><description>This model and its unit get Hit &amp; Run Shooter.</description></rule><rule id="cust-36-0000016" name="Unstoppable in Melee Aura" hidden="false"><description>This model and its unit get Unstoppable on weapons in melee.</description></rule><rule id="cust-36-0000017" name="Shred when Shooting Aura" hidden="false"><description>This model and its unit get Shred on weapons when shooting.</description></rule><rule id="cust-36-0000018" name="Steadfast Aura" hidden="false"><description>This model and its unit get Steadfast.</description></rule><rule id="cust-36-0000019" name="Dash Aura" hidden="false"><description>This model and its unit get Dash.</description></rule><rule id="cust-36-0000020" name="Ranged Shrouding Aura" hidden="false"><description>This model and its unit get Ranged Shrouding.</description></rule><rule id="cust-36-0000021" name="Unstoppable in Melee" hidden="false"><description>This model's melee weapons get Unstoppable.</description></rule><rule id="cust-36-0000022" name="Shred when Shooting" hidden="false"><description>This model's shooting weapons get Shred.</description></rule><rule id="cust-36-0000025" name="Armor(2)" hidden="false"><description>While the item granting this rule is equipped, this model uses Defense 2+.</description></rule><rule id="opr-spellcat-cust-rule-1" name="Guardian Protection (1)" hidden="false"><description>Pick one friendly unit within 12&quot;, which gets Enhanced Guardian once (next time the effect would apply).</description></rule><rule id="opr-spellcat-cust-rule-2" name="Dread Strike (1)" hidden="false"><description>Pick one enemy model within 18&quot; in line of sight, which takes 1 hit with AP(2) and Disintegrate. Resolve the effect as if the model were a unit of [1].</description></rule><rule id="opr-spellcat-cust-rule-3" name="The Founder's Curse (2)" hidden="false"><description>Pick up to two enemy units within 18&quot; in line of sight; friendly units get Shred on their weapons when attacking those targets once (next time the effect would apply).</description></rule><rule id="opr-spellcat-cust-rule-4" name="Thunderous Mist (2)" hidden="false"><description>Pick one enemy unit within 18&quot; in line of sight, which takes 4 hits.</description></rule><rule id="opr-spellcat-cust-rule-5" name="Focused Defender (3)" hidden="false"><description>Pick up to three friendly units within 18&quot;, which get Unpredictable Fighter once (next time the effect would apply).</description></rule><rule id="opr-spellcat-cust-rule-6" name="Mind Gash (3)" hidden="false"><description>Pick one enemy unit within 18&quot; in line of sight, which takes 6 hits with Shred.</description></rule></sharedRules><selectionEntries><selectionEntry id="opr-spellcat-cust-entry" name="Spell Catalogue" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="upgrade"><categoryLinks><categoryLink id="opr-spellcat-cust-category" name="Spell Catalogue" hidden="false" targetId="opr-spell-catalogue-category" primary="true"/></categoryLinks><infoLinks><infoLink id="opr-spellcat-cust-link-1" name="Guardian Protection (1)" hidden="false" targetId="opr-spellcat-cust-rule-1" type="rule"/><infoLink id="opr-spellcat-cust-link-2" name="Dread Strike (1)" hidden="false" targetId="opr-spellcat-cust-rule-2" type="rule"/><infoLink id="opr-spellcat-cust-link-3" name="The Founder's Curse (2)" hidden="false" targetId="opr-spellcat-cust-rule-3" type="rule"/><infoLink id="opr-spellcat-cust-link-4" name="Thunderous Mist (2)" hidden="false" targetId="opr-spellcat-cust-rule-4" type="rule"/><infoLink id="opr-spellcat-cust-link-5" name="Focused Defender (3)" hidden="false" targetId="opr-spellcat-cust-rule-5" type="rule"/><infoLink id="opr-spellcat-cust-link-6" name="Mind Gash (3)" hidden="false" targetId="opr-spellcat-cust-rule-6" type="rule"/></infoLinks><comment>Reference only; 0 points; does not grant Caster or spell effects. Source: Grimdark Future v3.6.0.</comment><constraints><constraint id="opr-spellcat-cust-min" type="min" value="1" field="selections" scope="force" shared="true"/><constraint id="opr-spellcat-cust-max" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="force" shared="true"/></constraints></selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="cust-36-0000030" name="Master Destroyer" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="unit"><profiles><profile id="cust-36-0000031" name="Master Destroyer" hidden="false" typeId="b174-c09d-3660-f010" typeName="Unit"><characteristics><characteristic name="Quality" typeId="b174-c09d-3660-f011">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Defense" typeId="b174-c09d-3660-f012">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Special Rules" typeId="b174-c09d-3660-f013">Fearless, Guardian, Hero, Tough(9)</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles><infoLinks><infoLink id="cust-36-0000032" name="Fearless" hidden="false" targetId="opr-core-fearless" type="rule"/><infoLink id="cust-36-0000033" name="Guardian" hidden="false" targetId="cust-36-0000001" type="rule"/><infoLink id="cust-36-0000034" name="Hero" hidden="false" targetId="opr-core-hero" type="rule"/></infoLinks><ca